{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onadd(_:perform:)-27g0l"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-8d74u","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-5cn3d","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/removeHooks(of:)"],"anchor":"Responding-to-Component-Changes-with-Hooks","generated":true,"title":"Responding to Component Changes with Hooks"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onAdd"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"type"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"hook"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"type","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component type to watch.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"hook","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The closure to run, given the world and the entity that gained a ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use hooks to keep data outside the components in step with them, such as an index of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entities by name. An "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"add hook"}]},{"type":"text","text":" runs when an entity that didn’t hold a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" gets one, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spawning, inserting or applying a command. Replacing a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" the entity already holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t run it; see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a hook that runs then too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example records each named entity in a resource as it’s spawned:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct NameDirectory: Resource { var entities: [String: Entity] = [:] }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(NameDirectory())","world.onAdd(Name.self) { world, entity in","    let name = world[Name.self, of: entity].value","    world.resources[NameDirectory.self].entities[name] = entity","}","","let hero = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Hero\"))","print(world.resources[NameDirectory.self].entities[\"Hero\"] == hero)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A hook runs after the world operation that fired it has finished, so it sees every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component a spawn or bundle insert gave. Hooks run in the order they were fired. A change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that a hook makes fires hooks of its own, which run after the hooks already waiting."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Changes made in place, through the world’s subscript or an update, run no hooks.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Find those with change detection instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1) amortized.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"onAdd(_:perform:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5onAdd_7performyxm_yACz_AA6EntityVtYbctAA9ComponentRzlF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onAdd","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},